{"time":1727724272637,"blocks":[{"id":"THbj86jwsE","type":"header","data":{"text":"Sobre el Proyecto","level":3},"tunes":{"textVariant":null}},{"id":"t2L12ubiYb","type":"paragraph","data":{"text":"En este proyecto utilizo sensores de entrada anal\u00f3gica para una monitorizaci\u00f3n constante de consumo energ\u00e9tico.<br>"},"tunes":{"textVariant":null}},{"id":"qd2DrrtvzE","type":"paragraph","data":{"text":"El objetivo es controlar cuanto est\u00e1n consumiendo los equipos <b>subiendo estos datos a mi API<\/b> y poder mejorar la <b>gesti\u00f3n de energ\u00eda<\/b> principalmente para realizar tareas m\u00e1s pesadas en algunos dispositivos (y por lo tanto de m\u00e1s consumo) en momentos d\u00f3nde tengo m\u00e1s energ\u00eda almacenada\/generada mediante placas solares y posponer otras tareas poco relevante.<br>"},"tunes":{"textVariant":null}},{"id":"wmSITPUDlh","type":"paragraph","data":{"text":"Utilizo una pantalla con ahorro de energ\u00eda implementado para apagarse tras un periodo de inactividad reactiv\u00e1ndose al pulsar de nuevo el bot\u00f3n.<br>"},"tunes":{"textVariant":null}},{"id":"u5wxQQaCz_","type":"header","data":{"text":"Hardware","level":3},"tunes":{"textVariant":null}},{"id":"p0IFINvpp5","type":"list","data":{"style":"unordered","items":["Microcontrolador <b>Raspberry Pi Pico W<\/b><br>","Pantalla <b>ST7735<\/b> 1.8 SPI 128x160","Sensor de intensidad <b>ACS712<\/b><br>","Sensor de voltaje <b>MAX471<\/b>","ADC extra de 4 canales <b>ADS1115<\/b>"]},"tunes":{"textVariant":null}},{"id":"mevqKFAdh9","type":"header","data":{"text":"Software","level":3},"tunes":{"textVariant":null}},{"id":"exhYeoOb8S","type":"paragraph","data":{"text":"El proyecto es open source y se encuentra alojado en gitlab <a href=\"https:\/\/gitlab.com\/raupulus\/rpi-pico-energy-monitor\">https:\/\/gitlab.com\/raupulus\/rpi-pico-energy-monitor<\/a> y en github <a href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/raupulus\/rpi-pico-energy-monitor\">https:\/\/github.com\/raupulus\/rpi-pico-energy-monitor<\/a>"},"tunes":{"textVariant":null}},{"id":"rtJn61hRtL","type":"header","data":{"text":"Galer\u00eda","level":3},"tunes":{"textVariant":null}},{"id":"i0od7kngjG","type":"image","data":{"file":{"url":"https:\/\/api.fryntiz.dev\/file\/thumbnail\/get\/content\/526\/frGDh9VRPSuPfyARoLSnjB1BkGXvjyH8fJA5S4NN.webp","path":"file\/thumbnail\/get\/content\/526\/frGDh9VRPSuPfyARoLSnjB1BkGXvjyH8fJA5S4NN.webp","url_thumbnail":"https:\/\/api.fryntiz.dev\/file\/thumbnail\/get\/content\/524\/frGDh9VRPSuPfyARoLSnjB1BkGXvjyH8fJA5S4NN.webp","path-thumbnail":"file\/thumbnail\/get\/content\/524\/frGDh9VRPSuPfyARoLSnjB1BkGXvjyH8fJA5S4NN.webp","url_large":"https:\/\/api.fryntiz.dev\/file\/thumbnail\/get\/content\/527\/frGDh9VRPSuPfyARoLSnjB1BkGXvjyH8fJA5S4NN.webp","path-large":"file\/thumbnail\/get\/content\/527\/frGDh9VRPSuPfyARoLSnjB1BkGXvjyH8fJA5S4NN.webp","content_id":9,"content_file_id":39,"file_id":110,"module":"content","title":"2023-02-14 20-10-22.jpeg","name":"frGDh9VRPSuPfyARoLSnjB1BkGXvjyH8fJA5S4NN.jpg","alt":"2023-02-14 20-10-22.jpeg","size":3652558,"extension":"jpg","mime":"image\/jpeg","file_type_image":"https:\/\/api.fryntiz.dev\/storage\/icons\/file_types\/mbNDMkptfPzR3n4hcnj2B4Slx1t5nPDc_128.webp"},"caption":"Proyecto monitor de energ\u00eda en desarrollo","withBorder":false,"stretched":false,"withBackground":false},"tunes":{"textVariant":null}},{"id":"3ksYGd4Fqs","type":"image","data":{"file":{"url":"https:\/\/api.fryntiz.dev\/file\/thumbnail\/get\/content\/531\/z7A6OcKbFxEflIRvRQdH7AhpQz47cgJ3KC1ZIovx.webp","path":"file\/thumbnail\/get\/content\/531\/z7A6OcKbFxEflIRvRQdH7AhpQz47cgJ3KC1ZIovx.webp","url_thumbnail":"https:\/\/api.fryntiz.dev\/file\/thumbnail\/get\/content\/529\/z7A6OcKbFxEflIRvRQdH7AhpQz47cgJ3KC1ZIovx.webp","path-thumbnail":"file\/thumbnail\/get\/content\/529\/z7A6OcKbFxEflIRvRQdH7AhpQz47cgJ3KC1ZIovx.webp","url_large":"https:\/\/api.fryntiz.dev\/file\/thumbnail\/get\/content\/532\/z7A6OcKbFxEflIRvRQdH7AhpQz47cgJ3KC1ZIovx.webp","path-large":"file\/thu